{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"c89c1cb2f7106cc4fa131e4b65590d31a92319c442d158354913e77123dd9c68","ja":"京都でのツアー中、4人はとあるショッピングモールで\n買い出しをしていた……","zh":"在京都巡演期间，4人在某家购物中心\n采购物品……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f21a9a0617d03370b2f1c07c5e529c2970fb4fc4c792f123b841508b42baa77a","ja":"お待たせいたしました！　お茶に、運動用飲料……\nこれくらいでよろしいでしょうか？","zh":"让您久等了！　有茶，还有运动饮料……\n这些可以吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bfd8e5eee2c139eaba75e6ec552d6bb7c6c354587ba007e3978a882f81e8b7fa","ja":"そうね、十分だと思う。私たちの方も、\nタオルとか買ったし、必要なものは全部揃ったかな。","zh":"是呢，我觉得足够了。我们这边也买了\n毛巾之类的，需要的东西应该都准备齐了吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1a3960370ce6fe2e036378f3164c109005050cc807d5525ccfd1ee6c5ffd8d6d","ja":"じゃあそろそろ帰ってレッスンを、って……。","zh":"那就差不多该回去练习了，等等……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d07e2502240c243e4e8abe90dfdeaed3169f7f27d035b0721cca8f3dc059e23b","ja":"あれっ、亜美は？","zh":"哎呀，亚美呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f39582999b32296387d8886f0f33d3ced0e17eafe48597cb8f22630bce991410","ja":"それが、さっきまで一緒にいたんですけど……。","zh":"可是，刚才还在一起的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"bf2d2d4b9562ecd40b397598468547c86f42355495b1a16554edad9fcd4c6eeb","ja":"「ちょっとお菓子売り場を見てくる」って言ってから、\n戻ってこないんです。","zh":"说了一句“去点心专区看一下”，\n之后就一直没回来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c9f46d33081072a0706f9b1a56820ab3c32045afb97b2aa715a14ac498a7e4ca","ja":"もしかして、\n迷われているのでしょうか……？","zh":"您难道是在\n犹豫吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0b34d9833db622be66a44b4353f488eb37059891ed8ba87f350ef9053998d788","ja":"ここ、結構広いもんな～。\n待ってるのもなんだし、亜美に連絡してみよっか？","zh":"这里还挺大的呢～。\n干等着也不是个事，要不联系一下亚美看看？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"731105f7fdd6d91071511f00ba9165c57441c4bef67c784fa1b6c702674ae78d","ja":"ピロリンッ！","zh":"叮咚！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1ce75dbbf4a264546c8f79d383ae925ce000ccb07fd331b96e0f0a48ab660116","ja":"あ……ちょうど、亜美からメッセージが……\nえっ……何、これ……！？","zh":"啊……正好收到了亚美发来的消息……\n咦……这、这是什么……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"4febc79e2f3aaa37d232767862f2342ec1a7278f3742122a8ad73cdb8f7e70ac","ja":"「ねぇねぇみんな！　ここって、広くていろんな\nお店があって、めっちゃハッピーだよね！」","zh":"“我说我说，大家！这里又宽敞，又有好多\n店铺，简直太让人开心了吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4cacd716a5951ee5475cee60f00a01b60b325c1e901db87c6f490a62e228deaf","ja":"「すぐに帰っちゃうなんて、もったいないっしょ～！？\nもっと遊んでこうよ！」","zh":"“马上就回去的话，也太可惜了吧～！？\n再多玩一会儿嘛！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1071.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a396e808c77f3455b3cef688af427d567dfc235cb1fcc228b5dbf66fb08d5b71","ja":"「というわけで、迷子アプリで亜美を見つけてちょ！\n捕まるまでは、帰らないよーん♪」","zh":"“所以说，快用寻人App找到亚美吧！\n被抓到之前，我可不回去唷～♪”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
